[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Digital and timing code-model requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-CM-D-BUFFER
TITLE: d_buffer code model
STATEMENT: >>>
The logic catalog shall expose d_buffer with logic terminals, drive state and delay. Validate terminal direction, domain, width and nullability against the executable schema.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Check truth or drive tables, timing and unknown states as applicable.
<<<

